FUNCTION_WORDS = frozenset("""
a an the and or but if as at by for from in into of on onto to with
is am are was were be been being do does did have has had can could will
would should may might must not no nor so than then that this these those
it its he she they them their we you i me my your our what which who when
where why how there here
